<title>ZAIRE: SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP WINNERS' CUP FINAL, FIRST LEG RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP WINNERS' CUP FINAL, FIRST LEG RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sodigraf (Zaire) and Arab Contractors (Egypt) drew 0-0 in the African Cup Winners' Cup final, first leg on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
